## 6. How to attach

### Cursor

1. Copy this file to the game project: `.cursor/rules/nexuslink-workflow.mdc`
2. Fill §5 project customization
3. Cursor Settings → Rules: ensure enabled (`alwaysApply: false` — loaded by description)

### Knot / other IDEs

1. Paste §1–§4 as project rules (complements InitializeInstructions; does not duplicate the routing table)
2. Fill §5 project info

### Maintenance

- After plugin upgrade: diff `Resources/AIRules.mdc` vs project copy; merge generic updates (including §3 parameter contract)
- Capability routing changes: follow UE `InitializeInstructions.*.md`; this rule covers flow and prohibitions only
